Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a place waiting for you in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know the woman\Nhe's trying to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to let go of that, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a forest of crystal\Nspikes down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She would die horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaz!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have lived for far too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your soul's decayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a pumpkin left\Nto rot out in a dead field.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.38,0:01:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even flies avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, grumble at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.80,0:01:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shout your lungs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heave your insults at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For as long as you're holding\Non to that rope, my friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's about all you can do.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.30,0:01:59.77,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.30,0:01:59.77,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shijima no Seiko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.60,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.60,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:06.98,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:06.98,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Diego o koe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishin o ga
Dialogue: 3,0:02:06.98,0:02:14.24,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.98,0:02:14.24,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.99,0:02:20.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.99,0:02:20.79,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.99,0:02:20.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.79,0:02:29.50,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.79,0:02:29.50,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.50,0:02:35.59,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.50,0:02:35.59,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.39,0:02:42.23,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.39,0:02:42.23,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.23,0:02:46.06,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.23,0:02:46.06,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.06,0:02:51.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.06,0:02:51.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.57,0:02:56.82,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.57,0:02:56.82,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.57,0:02:56.82,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.57,0:02:56.82,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.82,0:03:00.66,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.82,0:03:00.66,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.66,0:03:06.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.66,0:03:06.46,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.46,0:03:11.50,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.46,0:03:11.50,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.47,0:03:21.14,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,660)\pos(1250,865)\blur1\fscx84}Episode 24: "The Ties that Bind JoJo"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.47,0:03:21.14,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,660)\pos(1250,865)}Episode 24: "The Link to Jojo"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo! Lisa! Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't follow what's really going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't realize that's\Nhis mother he's holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, we need to tell Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet. But why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the proper time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you finished disposing\Nof those vampires yet?
