Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you're holding\Non so tightly to that rope,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your clumsy feet have limited reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His kick did make it to Kars,\Nbut there was no Hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're\Nrunning out of Hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it is possible you might have enough\Nleft to make one last-ditch attack on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll walk up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I'm going to take\Nyour life as easily as if
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I were plucking a little\Nflower along a garden pathway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe there is enough left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, Hamon, for one\Nlast desperate attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, even I don't know. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But either way, I've\Ndevised a cunning plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it's something\Nto make you choke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.90,0:05:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How badly do you want to know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm not telling! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see that you've stopped\Ntying those ropes together now.
