Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.14,0:06:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see this match?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I'm going\Nto be doing with this fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth is JoJo thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He set his scarf on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before this flame has a chance to burn me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find a way to use whatever\NI can to send you straight to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scarf is a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something to motivate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little pain to help me find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me.
