Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't toy with me, you're just dodging\Naround for a chance to catch your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no matter, I'm taking your\Nlife at the moment of my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of dealing\Nwith your silly antics.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, I need to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if I look silly doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly I can sever Lisa Lisa's rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With just a flick of my wrist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you dodge me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is exactly what I will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I press just a little harder?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so easy!
