Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ran away before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now come toward me slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you could stay where you are and\Nwatch as I cut through the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your life more precious than that\Nof the woman dangling down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's my choice!
