Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you think you're\Ndoing, but when I cut this line?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will both be impaled on the\Ncrystal spikes below, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo Lisa Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two birds with one cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's connected to Jojo!
