Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needed some kind of distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when he set his scarf on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then to tie the lines together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he maneuvered me into doing his work\Nfor him by cutting Lisa Lisa's rope.
