Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That manipulating cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.38,0:09:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're the one saving\Nboth me and Lisa Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deceived me, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How odd that I should hear you\Ncomplaining about trickery!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You enjoy deceiving others, but\Nnow the shoe's on the other foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have lived for over 10,000 years,
