Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:09:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was enough! Oh, yes! He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hit cars with his hormone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaos fell right onto\Nhis own crystal spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wah-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pillar man is done! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Hamon will travel right\Nup his arm and do the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:10:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're weak, your time on Earth is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mere human could finish you off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to spook us, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's eliminate him forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring out the Ultraviolet Amplifier!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kar said that he wasn't actually\Nplanning to kill you with his blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I don't think that\Nyour wounds are fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get you taken care of quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:12:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't think this is\Nthe day you're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it, and I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, um, can I please\Nask you something? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, why did Granny Arena lie to Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd she tell him that his mother\Nhad died when he was a little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does Lisa Lisa hide her past\Nand not tell him who she really is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smokey, that's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Granny Arena told me not to ask\Nyou, but I've got to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, she is his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping that information\Nfrom him is just awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo and Granny Arena, they're my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in New York, they both saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just a lowly pickpocket,\Nbut they helped me out anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do anything I can to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you, in New York you\Nproved what a good friend you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took excellent care\Nof Iran while I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this you can never reveal to Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the business\Nof the Joestar family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friends or not, we don't have\Nthe right to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name Lisa Lisa is made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An alias.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her real given name is Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raised and trained by the\NHarmon user Straitzo you met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She and Irina's son, George\NJoestar, fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:14:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon, George and Elizabeth had a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know him as Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo's father, George, enlisted as a\Nmember of Britain's Royal Flying Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aviation developed rapidly during\Nthe First World War and George
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was among the brave pilots to\Nfly into battle in the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stood out as a hero even among the\Nmembers of the Royal Flying Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was then that a gut-wrenching\Nhorror from the past
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,came back to haunt the\Nmembers of the Joestar family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifty years earlier, Dio Brando\Ncreated blood-sucking zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straitzo, myself, and the others\Nbelieved that we had exterminated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one of them had escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hid himself within society and\Nlived for decades undiscovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was cunning, intelligent,\Nsupremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He created no spawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He devoured the bones\Nand hair of his victims,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leaving behind no\Nevidence of his existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by some wretched,\Nwicked twist of fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he had placed himself in position as\Na commander in the Royal Flying Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Royal Flying Corps?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Jojo's father?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The very same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,George was observant and figured this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had listened well\Nto Straitzo and myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but ultimately, George\Nwas only an ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had character and talent, but he\Nhad no training in the ways of Hormone.
