Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His message to Straitzo was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,George's death was covered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an unfortunate night time plane crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straitzo and I found this suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we investigated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and eventually learn the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.50,0:16:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That night, Elizabeth held an infant Jojo\Nas I told her what we had discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of showing grief,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she ran out intent on bloody revenge.
