Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a witness to\Nthe commander's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The military knew nothing\Nabout zombies or Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They concluded that for\Nsome unknown reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elizabeth had attacked their\Nbeloved commander, killed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then burned his body to hide the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Words spread as only bad news can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and soon she was known around\Nthe world as a murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and traitor to the war effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We used all the resources of the\NSpeedwagon Foundation to cover her trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elizabeth had to leave England behind,\Nwithout even a word of goodbye to her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Erina knew what had occurred, and\Nshe gave me this specific request.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the child grows up\Nand asks about his parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please tell him they both died in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This child...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor little child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so it was that\NElizabeth became Lisa Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why why is it that way\Nat least let him know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his mother's not dead\Nsomewhere I know painfully?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:19:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran lost her husband and her son in the\Nbattle between Harmon and the Stone Masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thinking of her grandson,\Nher Joseph, her Jojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't want Harmon to create\Nyet another hole in her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa feels the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What tragedy for this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a miserable fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, it's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo used Hamon positively\Nto save his mother's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no reason for Lisa Lisa to\Nhide the truth from Jojo any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He already knows about Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he used it to save his mother's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.60,0:19:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:20:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, it's not my decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a question of how\NIran and Lisa Lisa feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess. Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready to fire, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone focus on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Und now we will share the honor\Nof executing cars. Jawohl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.36,0:20:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Ghaz, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't begin to tell you how good\Nit feels to give this order myself!
