Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see him with the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that he\Nhad it anywhere near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see him put in the red stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll feed you round about.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.14,0:22:08.64,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.64,0:22:12.19,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.19,0:22:17.44,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,We spend the day your way
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.44,0:22:20.03,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling money, money, fuel,\Nsummer, middle of the valley?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.03,0:22:23.78,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley... hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Living around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.78,0:22:26.20,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moms come out of the\Nsky, they stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.45,0:22:29.49,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.49,0:22:31.41,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.40,0:22:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I alone?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.50,0:22:38.17,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.00,0:22:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there, we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them to some of we'll be\Nthere, you'll be there too?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.80,0:22:44.34,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,24, 24, while you will sing!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.14,0:22:50.81,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.81,0:22:54.77,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,there with you
