Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has become the Ubermensch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.46,0:23:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has complete mastery over organic life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there really no way to stop him, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars the pillar man is no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.44,0:23:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's become Cars, the ultimate creation.
